{"availability":"available","full":"sbansal05/trusttrail","name":"trusttrail","description":"Your repayment record, portable across Solana","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-17T13:10:04Z","updated":"2026-10-12T16:48:41Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://trusttrail-ten.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://trusttrail-ten.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T06:37:58.587Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T06:37:58.587Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T06:37:58.587Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:38.236Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T19:34:29.624Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T06:37:58.587Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A portable, on-chain credit score for Solana lending — built from real wallet behavior, not self-reported claims.","Every major Solana lending protocol treats a wallet as an anonymous stranger with zero history, forcing heavy over-collateralization regardless of how long that wallet has been responsibly using DeFi. TrustTrail fixes the input problem: it turns a wallet's actual on-chain financial behavior — general activity patterns plus real lending history from Kamino — into a single, verifiable score that any protocol can read trustlessly."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sbansal05/trusttrail/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9ad0a9de6980ad8e455d297266e7e9a9bb5cf909e69992c5e58c64e743200ba6","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:38.397Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:29.747Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A portable, on-chain credit score for Solana lending — built from real wallet behavior, not self-reported claims.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sbansal05/trusttrail/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9ad0a9de6980ad8e455d297266e7e9a9bb5cf909e69992c5e58c64e743200ba6","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sban